    <string name="widgets_ios_step2" tools:ignore="UnusedResources">Ketuk “Edit” › “Tambah Widget” di bagian atas (atau “+” di versi iOS lama).</string>
    <string name="widgets_ios_step3" tools:ignore="UnusedResources">Cari “Crypto Checker”, pilih widget, lalu ketuk “Tambah Widget”.</string>
